# Backend API base URL, read server-side (Server Components). This is the
# only one that actually changes at container runtime — NEXT_PUBLIC_* vars
# are inlined into the client bundle at `next build` time, so changing the
# API host for client-side calls (create-bill's store/product fetches)
# requires passing it as a Docker build ARG, not just setting it here. Both
# fall back to the same production URL hardcoded in src/lib/api/config.ts,
# so this file only matters if you point the app at a different backend.
API_BASE_URL="http://103.91.204.103:8000/api/v1"
